        <mxCell id="legend_body" value="• Top row = 14 course sessions, coloured by topic arc: Refactor, Deploy/CI, Data, Quality, Scale/TLS, Security/IaC/Wrap.   • Lanes below = ON TIME (within the topic week), DELAYED (more than 2 weeks late, with a curved arrow up to the topic session and a +Nw label), and INCIDENTS &amp; OPERATIONS (outages, the parallel-stack run, the timeline 504s, the decommission).   • Box colour matches the column of the work's topic, so a blue box (S7 quality) sitting under May tells you instantly the work landed late.   • Bottom rail = git tags. Five tags ship before Mar 27 then nothing for 49 days — weekly releases didn't survive contact with the Swarm migration.   • Numbers (verified): 88 merged PRs, 69% self-merged, 5 commits with Co-Authored-By: Claude trailer (the Claude-direct commits are off-master so not in shipped history)." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=9;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
